sts/when-size-actually-matters-1\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/5219006807c2db33ea2b1afebda816a4\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"When size actually matters\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">12 Jan 13:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">When size actually matters</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">There are cars built for precision, efficiency and compromise – and then there are cars like the Dodge Ram SRT-10 and Chrysler Viper RT/1...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/our-favorites-from-2025-in-each-category\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/ba32dd76093c7344a91e29dd3e236540\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"Our favorites from 2025 in each category\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">09 Jan 15:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">Our favorites from 2025 in each category</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">A year on Bidders Highway doesn't pass in silence...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/sometimes-the-best-car-in-the-world-is-just-the-one-that-takes-you-home\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/8f9f339f31a223e6864773b04d3c193f\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"Sometimes the best car in the world is just the one that takes you home.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">08 Jan 13:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">Sometimes the best car in the world is just the one that takes you home.</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">We at Bidders Highway love to write about driving pleasure...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-year-in-the-rearview-mirror-part-2-%E2%80%93-odd-vehicles-this-years-new-veterans-and-heart-pounding-no-reserve-auctions\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/1e281fe9a5ed37733ca6e932bfb5c5b0\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The year in the rearview mirror part 2 – Odd vehicles, this year's new veterans and heart-pounding &quot;No reserve&quot; auctions!\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">29 Dec 14:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The year in the rearview mirror part 2 – Odd vehicles, this year's new veterans and heart-pounding \"No reserve\" auctions!</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">If part one of our annual summary was about numbers, records and pure demand, this part is more about emotion...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-year-in-the-rearview-mirror-%E2%80%93-most-sold-most-bids-on-and-most-talked-about\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/27f76959b7326ca8a0df12307943783b\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The year in the rearview mirror – Most sold, most bids on and most talked about\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">22 Dec 14:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The year in the rearview mirror – Most sold, most bids on and most talked about</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">Whether you're selling your car or chasing your next dream car, the essence of auction is the same: anticipation, excitement and the will...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"