 font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The longing for nature - Without compromise!</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">Today, you no longer have to compromise on convenience and comfort if you have a love for nature...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-ceo-has-the-floor---november\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/16f6b3e32ed9f589c6acfe13d2d71e07\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The CEO has the floor - November\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">28 Nov 12:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The CEO has the floor - November</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">November is going down in history as our strongest month to date, with a sell-through rate that has sometimes reached 90%...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/buy-your-next-enthusiast-car-at-auction---a-new-era-for-car-buyers\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/7971ba8e96c9ec93d10718836b09c003\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"Buy your next enthusiast car at auction - A new era for car buyers\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">20 Nov 14:40</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">Buy your next enthusiast car at auction - A new era for car buyers</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">Buying a car at auction is a bit like going on a treasure hunt...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/save-the-manuals-%E2%80%93-why-we-refuse-to-let-go-of-the-manual-transmission\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/10e5804f3c821b747e872f6c0456b460\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"Save the Manuals – Why we refuse to let go of the manual transmission\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">14 Nov 14:40</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">Save the Manuals – Why we refuse to let go of the manual transmission</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">There are expressions that only enthusiasts understand. “Save the Manuals” is one of them...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/why-you-should-choose-a-modern-classic-as-your-daily-driver\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/f256d568432db0cf133d9301616eb8bd\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"Why you should choose a &quot;Modern Classic&quot; as your daily driver\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">06 Nov 16:40</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">Why you should choose a \"Modern Classic\" as your daily driver</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">It’s no secret that modern classics – cars from the late ’80s to the early 2000s – have been on the rise...</p></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"mb-8\"><div class=\"bg-off-white py-2\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pagination flex gap-2 justify-center items-center\"><a href=\"https://www.biddershighway.com/en/posts?page=2\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-colors bg-white border-2 border-jaffa text-jaffa hover:bg-jaffa hover:text-white text-xl\">←</a><a href=\"https://www.biddershighway.com/en/posts?page=1\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-colors font-medium bg-white border-2 border-jaffa text-jaffa hover:bg-jaffa hover:text-white\">1</a><a href=\"https://www.biddershighway.com/en/posts?page=2\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-fu